   "title": "Shadow gate",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Shadow gate.** Generated colour is unreliable in deep shadows, so below a source brightness of 32/255 the colour is made neutral, with a ramp up to 96/255. The weight is built from the source Y with mask arithmetic: weight = clamp(4 x (Y - 0.125)). Delete these nodes and feed the result U and V straight into *Source Y + result U V* if you want the ungated colour."
   ],
   "color": "#3b3b2e",
   "bgcolor": "#5a5a3a"
  },
